sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Parent
  participant CH as Telegram
  participant I as Ingest Lambda
  participant Q as SQS FIFO
  participant W as Worker Lambda
  participant D as DynamoDB
  participant T as SQS timers
  actor C as Adult child
  P->>CH: forwards QR image
  CH->>I: webhook (secret token)
  I->>I: check secret token, normalise
  I->>Q: enqueue (group = parent)
  I-->>CH: 200 OK (fast)
  Q->>W: image event
  W->>D: create PENDING_CHECK (decoding)
  W->>CH: "Siapa minta bayar?" [Bank/Polis/Mahkamah] [Kurier] [Keluarga/Kawan/Kedai]
  CH->>P: question appears
  W->>Q: enqueue "decode" job (same group)
  Q->>W: decode job
  W->>CH: download image
  W->>W: decode QR + classify (image then discarded)
  W->>D: save decode_result (decoded / failed)
  P->>CH: taps "Bank/Polis/Mahkamah"
  CH->>I: webhook
  I->>Q: enqueue (same group → waits until decode is done)
  Q->>W: button event
  W->>D: read check, run verdict rules
  W->>CH: STOP: "Jangan bayar. Letak telefon..."
  CH->>P: verdict
  W->>D: create ALERT (PRIMARY_SENT)
  W->>CH: "AMARAN: Telefon Mak sekarang..." [Saya uruskan]
  CH->>C: alert
  W->>T: schedule escalation check (+180 s)
